 leader line.\n*   **Clearances/Barriers:** No clearances or barriers shown.\n*   **Enclosed/Niche:** Appears to be an open, freestanding pad configuration.\n\n**5. Transformer Pad South of Building 7**\n*   **Location:** South of Building 7, specifically situated adjacent to the southern facade of Unit 703.\n*   **Dimensions:** Not labeled.\n*   **Proximity:** Positioned in the space between the southern facade of Building 7 and the southern property boundary line. It is located just west of an \"Electrical Pull Box\".\n*   **Access door orientation:** Not indicated.\n*   **Type (Oil-filled/Dry):** Not indicated.\n*   **Callouts/Notes:** Labeled exactly \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\" with a leader line.\n*   **Clearances/Barriers:** No clearances or barriers shown.\n*   **Enclosed/Niche:** Appears to be an open, freestanding pad configuration. \n\n*(Note: Because this is labeled a \"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan,\" fine details such as dimensions, bollards, access door orientations, and transformer types are universally absent from the schematic representation.)*","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1462,"outputTokens":983,"totalTokens":4911,"reasoningTokens":2466},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2092056]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely 