{"level":30,"time":1776368739446,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014JQ2vXE5P9ws6vF3j7J2hP","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Sheet 33 — Canopy Impact Exhibit\n     2→\n     3→Exhibits detailing tree canopy calculations and construction impact analysis.\n     4→\n     5→## Reading Guide\n     6→\n     7→This sheet presents canopy impact exhibits for four specific trees to be preserved on the Valley View Townhomes project site. Each exhibit includes a plan view showing the mapped tree canopy intersecting with proposed construction, a photograph of the existing tree, and calculations detailing the total canopy area and the square footage and percentage of construction overbuild. \n     8→\n     9→**Key values**:\n    10→*   Tree 4026H Canopy: Total Area = 3917 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 173.38 sqft (4.43%)\n    11→*   Tree 4019H Canopy: Total Area = 2545 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 52.39 sqft (2.06%)\n    12→*   Tree 4038H Canopy (Detail 2): Total Area = 1786 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 82.29 sqft (4.60%)\n    13→*   Tree 4034 Canopy (Detail 1, text labeled 4038H): Total Area = 1188 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 231.9 sqft (19.52%)\n    14→*   Overbuild offset: 4' (typical for all exhibits)\n    15→*   Drawing Scale: 1\" = 10'-0\"\n    16→\n    17→**Content blocks on this sheet**:\n    18→\n    19→*   **Block 1**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4026H. READ for precise canopy calculations; Use VISION to see the spatial relationship between the tree canopy, the 4' overbuild offset, and the proposed building and fence.\n    20→*   **Block 2**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4019H. READ for specific area calculations; Use VISION to assess the overlap with the proposed building and the adjacent \"no posts in half CRZ\" fence line.\n    21→*   **Block 3**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4034 (Note: The calculation text block incorrectly labels this as Tree 4038H). READ for exact calculations; Use VISION to examine the extensive canopy overlap shading relative to the proposed sidewalk, retaining wall, and building.\n    22→*   **Block 4**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4038H. READ for canopy calculations and the specific note regarding Tree 4039 (\"to be mitigated in place\"); Use VISION to observe the spatial overlap with the proposed driveway, curb, and transformer.\n    23→*   **Block 5**: Legend detailing symbology for canopy plans. READ to understand the symbols for actual tree canopies and existing canopy over proposed building (hatching).\n    24→*   **Block 6**: Project title block. READ for basic administrative details including the project name (Valley View Townhomes), owner (WM 41 Austin RE, LLC), and address.\n    25→\n    26→---\n    27→\n    28→All other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n    29→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"533d2716-803a-462f-887c-92de310aeb2f","uuid":"b27cca45-8651-4f30-af45-d0d3f4a927c2","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-33/guide.md","content":"# Sheet 33 — Canopy Impact Exhibit\n\nExhibits detailing tree canopy calculations and construction impact analysis.\n\n## Reading Guide\n\nThis sheet presents canopy impact exhibits for four specific trees to be preserved on the Valley View Townhomes project site. Each exhibit includes a plan view showing the mapped tree canopy intersecting with proposed construction, a photograph of the existing tree, and calculations detailing the total canopy area and the square footage and percentage of construction overbuild. \n\n**Key values**:\n*   Tree 4026H Canopy: Total Area = 3917 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 173.38 sqft (4.43%)\n*   Tree 4019H Canopy: Total Area = 2545 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 52.39 sqft (2.06%)\n*   Tree 4038H Canopy (Detail 2): Total Area = 1786 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 82.29 sqft (4.60%)\n*   Tree 4034 Canopy (Detail 1, text labeled 4038H): Total Area = 1188 sqft; Construction Overbuild = 231.9 sqft (19.52%)\n*   Overbuild offset: 4' (typical for all exhibits)\n*   Drawing Scale: 1\" = 10'-0\"\n\n**Content blocks on this sheet**:\n\n*   **Block 1**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4026H. READ for precise canopy calculations; Use VISION to see the spatial relationship between the tree canopy, the 4' overbuild offset, and the proposed building and fence.\n*   **Block 2**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4019H. READ for specific area calculations; Use VISION to assess the overlap with the proposed building and the adjacent \"no posts in half CRZ\" fence line.\n*   **Block 3**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4034 (Note: The calculation text block incorrectly labels this as Tree 4038H). READ for exact calculations; Use VISION to examine the extensive canopy overlap shading relative to the proposed sidewalk, retaining wall, and building.\n*   **Block 4**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4038H. READ for canopy calculations and the specific note regarding Tree 4039 (\"to be mitigated in place\"); Use VISION to observe the spatial overlap with the proposed driveway, curb, and transformer.\n*   **Block 5**: Legend detailing symbology for canopy plans. READ to understand the symbols for actual tree canopies and existing canopy over proposed building (hatching).\n*   **Block 6**: Project title block. READ for basic administrative details including the project name (Valley View Townhomes), owner (WM 41 Austin RE, LLC), and address.\n\n---\n\nAll other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n","numLines":29,"startLine":1,"totalLines":29}}}
