{"level":30,"time":1776369122986,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Please analyze Sheet 9 (Site Plan) and identify:\n1. Any overhead electric (OHE) lines shown on the plan\n2. The location of utility poles or electrical poles\n3. Any electrical equipment such as transformers, pad-mounted equipment, pull boxes\n4. Any underground electric lines or equipment with their locations\n\nDescribe the spatial arrangement and indicate which buildings or site areas have electrical infrastructure nearby.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of Sheet 9 (Site Plan), here are the details regarding the electrical infrastructure as requested:\n\n**1. Overhead Electric (OHE) Lines**\n*   **Southern Boundary:** A line explicitly labeled with **`- OHE -`** runs horizontally along the entire southern property line (bottom edge of the drawing), passing near the \"Begin Concrete Retaining Wall\" and the proposed location for Building 8.\n*   **Northern Boundary:** Another line labeled with **`- OHE -`** runs horizontally along the northern property boundary (top edge of the drawing), beginning near the wastewater/water service connections on the west side and extending eastward.\n\n**2. Location of Utility Poles or Electrical Poles**\n*   While typical circular symbols representing poles are present along the paths of the overhead electric lines, explicit textual labels for \"Utility Pole\" or \"Power Pole\" are not clearly written on this sheet. However, the presence of the overhead lines (`- OHE -`) along the northern and southern property lines indicates the physical location of the overhead utility pole infrastructure bordering the site. \n\n**3. Electrical Equipment (Transformers, Pad-Mounted Equipment, Pull Boxes)**\n*   **Transformer Pad:** There is a pad explicitly labeled **\"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\"** located on the western side of the site. \n    *   **Spatial Arrangement:** It is situated immediately west of **Bldg. 2** (specifically near Unit 201), adjacent to a \"Tree Well\" and the \"Construct Type III Driveway\". It is centrally located near the main western entrance to service the development.\n*   *Note: No specific pull boxes or other pad-mounted electrical equipment are explicitly labeled on this architectural site plan sheet.*\n\n**4. Underground Electric Lines or Equipment**\n*   **Electric Easements:** While specific routing lines for underground electric (such as -E- or -UE- connecting to individual buildings) are not drawn on this general site plan, specific land reservations for electrical use are labeled:\n    *   **Eastern Boundary:** There is a **\"5' Electric Easement\"** labeled along the eastern property line (right edge of the drawing), running vertically next to the existing retaining wall and adjacent apartment building.\n    *   **Southeast Corner:** There is a label for a **\"5' Elec. & Tele. Easement\"** located at the bottom right corner of the property, tying into the southern boundary.\n*   The actual underground conduit routing from the \"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\" to the individual buildings (Bldgs 1-8) is not visually depicted on this page, which is typical for a general site layout plan (these details are normally reserved for dedicated MEP or utility sheets).","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1395,"outputTokens":571,"totalTokens":4506,"reasoningTokens":2540},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2702484]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducin