 **Southwest Corner Area (Bottom Left):**\n    *   **Label designation:** **\"M\"** (Mitigation Tree).\n    *   **Estimated trunk location:** The trunk (center point of the circle) is located directly north of the \"-OHE-\" line. Based on the scale, the trunk appears to be approximately **7 to 10 feet** north of the \"-OHE-\" line.\n    *   **Estimated canopy spread:** The circular canopy symbol has a radius roughly equivalent to 10 feet (a 20-foot total canopy spread).\n    *   **Approximate distances/overlap:** Because the estimated canopy radius (~10 feet) is greater than or equal to the estimated trunk distance from the line (~7-10 feet), the southern edge of the drawn canopy **directly overlaps and extends past** the \"-OHE-\" line by an estimated 1 to 3 feet.\n\n*   **Southeast Corner Area (Bottom Right):**\n    *   **Label designation:** There are two distinct trees near this corner, both labeled **\"M\"** (Mitigation Tree).\n    *   **Estimated trunk locations:** Both trunks are located north of the \"-OHE-\" line. Visually, they appear slightly further from the line than the SW tree, estimated at approximately **10 to 12 feet** north of the \"-OHE-\" line.\n    *   **Estimated canopy spread:** Both have circular canopy symbols with a radius roughly equivalent to 10 feet (a 20-foot total canopy spread).\n    *   **Approximate distances/overlap:** The southern edges of both canopies extend to approximately the same location as the \"-OHE-\" line. On the drawing, the canopy circles appear to directly **touch or slightly overlap** the dashed utility line.\n\n**3. Notation Marks, Measurement Dimensions, or Clearance Annotations**\n*   **None are present.** After thoroughly reviewing the southern boundary line, the \"IRRIGATION NOTES\", the general \"NOTE\" section, and the \"KEY NOTES\", there are absolutely **no notation marks, dimension lines, or text annotations** indicating required utility clearance zones, offset distances, or acknowledging conflict mitigation regarding the overhead electric line. The designer has placed the tree symbols based solely on their landscape layout without any explicit drawn indication of utility clearance requirements on this specific sheet."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015NsDFTMFyqMDpfKEpSkiAS","session_id":"df64853a-4f90-499d-b38e-749986aed001","uuid":"c961ebde-6ba2-453c-befc-a0b7eac0dcf1"}
