ic spacing labeled\n   - Cannot verify minimum clearances without measurements\n\n6. **EL-13.36 (Electrical routing 100% on private property)** - NOT-VERIFIABLE or PASS\n   - All pads appear to be on private property based on boundary\n   - But electrical routing to meter not fully traced on plans\n   - Can partially pass on transformer pad location, but routing not fully documented\n\nI need to focus on what I can definitively determine as FAIL or NOT-VERIFIABLE, excluding items that pass or don't apply.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3140,"cache_read_input_tokens":75018,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3140},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"533d2716-803a-462f-887c-92de310aeb2f","uuid":"63909f3f-70e8-42ac-81ed-bd265e071915"}
