{"level":30,"time":1776369377824,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":1,"prompt":"This is the first sheet of the document. Please identify what sheet this is and provide a table of contents or index showing the sheet numbers and titles for all sheets in this plan set. Specifically, what sheet number is the landscape plan or landscape planting plan?","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the provided document, here is the requested information:\n\n**1. Sheet Identification**\nThis is the **Cover** sheet. This is indicated in the bottom right corner of the document (\"Sheet: 1 of 39\") and within the \"Sheet List Table\" which lists Sheet Number 1 as \"Cover\".\n\n**2. Table of Contents / Index (Sheet List Table)**\nBelow is the exact reproduction of the \"Sheet List Table\" found in the upper right quadrant of the document:\n\n| Sheet Number | Sheet Title |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | Cover |\n| 2 | Survey |\n| 3 | General Notes |\n| 4 | Existing Conditions Survey |\n| 5 | Erosion and Sedimentation Control Plan |\n| 6 | Erosion Control Notes |\n| 7 | Erosion Control Details |\n| 8 | Tree Removal & Demolition Plan |\n| 9 | Site Plan |\n| 10 | Fire Protection Plan |\n| 11 | Grading Plan |\n| 12 | Storm Sewer Plan |\n| 13 | Drainage Area Map |\n| 14 | Inlet Drainage Area Map |\n| 15 | Biofiltration-Detention Pond Plan & Calculations |\n| 16 | Biofiltration-Detention Pond Profiles |\n| 17 | Conveyance Cross Sections |\n| 18 | Austin Water General Information & Construction Notes |\n| 19 | Utility Tap Plan |\n| 20 | Utility Tap Public Plan & Profile |\n| 21 | Preliminary Electrical Design Plan |\n| 22 | Construction Details 1 |\n| 23 | Construction Details 2 |\n| 24 | Construction Details 3 |\n| 25 | Construction Details 4 |\n| 26 | Construction Details 5 |\n| 27 | Construction Details 6 |\n| 28 | Construction Deta