{"level":30,"time":1776369506309,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Cw1SGNe9Z2V8ipbj448TGT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Rbz63R4jM5b7ZxhKjmQncT","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"13","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.1","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4","UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":["All five transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 21 - Preliminary Electrical Design Plan"}],"comment":"Five transformer pads are shown on the electrical plan adjacent to Buildings 1, 2, 4, 7, and 8, but no clearance dimensions are provided from pad edges to building foundations or structures. Minimum 5-foot clearance cannot be verified from available plans."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.2","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining walls throughout site perimeter and interior"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 11 - Grading Plan"}],"comment":"Existing stone retaining walls and proposed retaining walls are shown on grading and site plans, but no clearance dimensions from transformer pads to retaining wall faces are provided. Minimum 5-foot clearance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Property perimeter fences and interior fence locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 9 - Site Plan"}],"comment":"Fences are shown on site plan, but no dimensions indicate clearances from transformer pads to fence lines. Without documented access door orientation, cannot verify 5-foot (with operators) or 3-foot (without operators) clearance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Sidewalk areas adjacent to transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 21 - Preliminary Electrical Design Plan"}],"comment":"Sidewalks are shown adjacent to transformer pads on electrical and site plans, but clearance from back of sidewalk to pad edge is not dimensioned. Minimum 2-foot clearance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All five transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 21 - Preliminary Electrical Design Plan"}],"comment":"Transformer pads are shown without access door orientation indicated. No hot-stick clearance dimensions are provided from pad to open area or adjacent buildings/structures. Minimum 10-foot clearance to access door side cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.13","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4","ECM Appendix F"],"applicableAreas":["Landscape areas surrounding transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":32}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 31 - Landscape Plan"},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 32 - Tree List"}],"comment":"Trees are shown on landscape plan and tree list (Tree 4038H, 24-inch Live Oak marked 'Appendix F Y'), but no dimensions are provided showing horizontal distances between tree trunk centerlines and transformer pad edges. Cannot verify 10-foot lateral clearance for pad-mounted equipment or 15-foot for overhead conductors (none shown)."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Planted landscaping areas adjacent to transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 31 - Landscape Plan"}],"comment":"Landscape planting plan shows vegetation throughout site, including areas near transformer locations, but no clearance dimensions are provided from shrubs/vegetation to transformer pads. Minimum 10-foot clearance from access door side and 5-foot from other sides cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Trees within 20 lateral feet of underground electric equipment"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":32}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Sheet 32 - Tree List"}],"comment":"No root barrier details or specifications are shown on landscape plan or detail sheets. If trees exist within 20 lateral feet of transformer pads (underground electric equipment), required 4-foot deep root barriers installed 5 feet from equipment cannot be verified as present."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.19","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Fire lane circulation routes on site"],"sheet