ry. \n*   Specific callouts point to infrastructure, such as the \"**AT&T Pole**\" in the northwest corner.\n\n**5. What utilities are shown on this plan - water, sewer, electric, or others?**\nThe plan shows a comprehensive layout of multiple utility types, indicated by linetypes, equipment pads, and specific notes:\n*   **Electric:** Overhead lines marked \"**--- OHE ---**\", multiple rectangular features labeled \"**Transformer Pad (Typ.)**\" located near the proposed buildings, and \"**5' Electric Easement**\" boundaries. \n*   **Water:** Underground lines marked \"**--- W ---**\", an \"**Existing Water Manhole**\" (top left), and a \"**Water Meter**\" vault.\n*   **Wastewater/Sewer:** Underground lines marked \"**--- S ---**\", a \"**Wastewater Service Connection**\" (top left), and cleanouts labeled \"**CO**\". \n*   **Storm Drainage:** Underground lines marked \"**--- SD ---**\", a large \"**Detention Pond**\" at the northeast corner, and a \"**25' Drainage Easement**\".\n*   **Telecommunications:** An \"**AT&T Pole**\" (top left) and a boundary marked \"**5' Elec & Tele Easement**\".","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1447,"outputTokens":896,"totalTokens":4853,"reasoningTokens":2510},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerA