 35 (Plant Schedule)**: Proposed trees include Live Oak, Cedar Elm, Texas Mountain Laurel, and Mexican Redbud\n\n**Measurement Results:**\n- Southern boundary trees: 0.0 feet from OHE line (HIGH confidence)\n- Northern boundary trees: 0.5 feet from OHE line (MEDIUM confidence)\n\nAll findings have been submitted in structured format with specific code citations, locations, and requirements for applicant correction."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3328,"cache_read_input_tokens":77389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3328},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f35260c3-5e1a-4786-b2cb-3f3a59e76a22","uuid":"303e7eb9-0f87-44bd-98a7-6f9bba2ad669"}
