{"level":30,"time":1776370191117,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01MxEnQUkyEVv2byvpfBg9nf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I've successfully submitted my findings. Let me verify that I've covered all the applicable items appropriately:\n\n**FAIL items submitted (3):**\n1. EL-13.31 - Missing cross-sections\n2. EL-13.37 - Missing AE Design details and pad specifications\n3. EL-13.38 - Missing bollards for Pads 1 & 2\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE items submitted (16):**\n1. EL-13.1 - No clearance dimensions shown\n2. EL-13.6 - Transformer type not specified\n3. EL-13.7 - Exact sidewalk clearance not provided\n4. EL-13.10 - Clearance dimensions not shown\n5. EL-13.13 - Transformer locations not on landscape plan\n6. EL-13.14 - Transformer locations not on landscape plan\n7. EL-13.15 - Transformer locations not on landscape plan\n8. EL-13.21 - Water line distances not dimensioned\n9. EL-13.22 - Wastewater line distances not dimensioned\n10. EL-13.23 - Storm drain distance not dimensioned\n11. EL-13.25 - Underground utility distances not documented\n12. EL-13.26 - Over/under utilities not verified\n13. EL-13.32 - Transformer type not specified\n14. EL-13.34 - Not all easements depicted\n15. EL-13.35 - Easement boundaries not shown\n16. EL-13.36 - Routing on private property not documented\n\nThis looks comprehensive. I've identified 19 findings total - 3 fails and 16 not-verifiable - which represents a significant number of compliance gaps related to the transformer pad design and documentation. The primary issues are:\n\n\n- Missing Austin Energy Design approvals and specifications\n- Lack of dimensioned clearances on plans\n- Inconsistent bollard protection\n- Inability to verify landscaping/tree proximity due to missing transformer locations on landscape plan\n- Missing