{"level":30,"time":1776370305404,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01TNo7ccF8EP6jpS42Uza3q6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I've now added a comprehensive set of deficiencies covering the key issues:\n\nFAIL items:\n- EL-1.7: Missing building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor data\n- EL-1.8: Missing section/plan dimension annotations for clearances\n- EL-1.17: Missing wall section exhibits with conductor clearance dimensions\n- EL-1.31: Missing registered surveyor mid-span clearance data\n- EL-1.37: Proposed trees not utility-compatible and not verified\n- EL-1.46: Missing 48-hour notification requirement note\n\nNOT-VERIFIABLE items:\n- EL-1.1: Building clearances cannot be verified without surveyed data\n- EL-1.2: Radial clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.3: Building projection clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.9: Fence clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.10: Fence post clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.14: Retaining wall clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.18: Driveway vertical clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.19: Parking vertical clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.23: Dimension origins cannot be verified\n- EL-1.27: Facilities within easements lack clearance documentation\n- EL-1.28: Water meter clearances cannot be verified\n- EL-1.43: Transformer vertical clearances cannot be verified\n\nThis is a comprehensive set of deficiencies that capture the major gaps in the site plan regarding overhead electric line clearances. The core issues are:\n1. Missing building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor locations\n2. Missing dimension annotations for clearances\n3. Missing registered surveyor mid-span clearance data\n4. Tree species not verified as utility-compatible\n5. Missing notification requirement note\n6. Various site features (fences, walls, structures) lacking clearance documentation\n\n\nLet me check if there are other items I should flag. Several elements aren't applicable here—no gas canopies, stairs, or buildings within the right-of-way are shown on the plan. Similarly, there's no substation, vehicle barriers, or walls near the conductors that would trigger additional requirements. These can be marked as N/A since they don't apply to this particular site.\n\nFor items that might be relevant, poles are positioned at the edges rather than blocking driveway access, so that appears acceptable. Streetlights and sidewalks may warrant review depending on the final design, though the current layout doesn't show obvious conflicts. Underground water service and the absence of trash under the lines both pass inspection. Line crossings don't appear to be a concern for this configuration.\n\nMoving through the remaining checklist items: marquee signs and new poles aren't shown since the project uses underground service. Decorative lighting isn't clearly visible in the plans, and there are no apparent issues with streetlights near the development. Guy wires and easements aren't clearly identified. Transformers aren't located in a niche configuration. Construction staging could present worker safety considerations and may be difficult to verify at this stage. If roof penetrations are shown for service connections, that would need evaluation.\n\nFor the construction staging item specifically, the applicability criteria require that staging areas be shown on site logistics plans with documented clearances. Since no construction logistics plan is included with the submission, this likely falls outside the scope rather than representing a verifiable deficiency. The 16 identified issues appear to capture the substantive gaps in how the site plan addresses overhead electric clearance requirements.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6455,"cache_read_input_tokens":85911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6455},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1e954d11-1eb9-4d3c-b419-4ac7a7240f6a","uuid":"ceae9998-2c45-42b3-b076-f465b21871be"}
