{"level":30,"time":1776370385768,"pid":59252,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BwragQKU5oxmqPDtzAr4My","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013KDQqFneZPYYoqFeej1mr9","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"1","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All building elevations; Building 1 through Building 8"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Building elevation sheets with surveyed overhead conductor locations and elevations are not provided. No architectural elevation views show the vertical relationship between overhead conductors and building features (roofs, parapets, overhangs) required to verify compliance with 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Site plan; building perimeters near overhead electric lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Section and plan view exhibits with dimension lines from the outside electric conductor to building edges and projections are not provided. While overhead electric lines (OHE) are depicted on the site plan, no clearance dimensions are annotated from the conductors to buildings, parking, driveways, or other facilities."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.17","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining wall locations along east and south property boundaries near overhead electric lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38},{"d