atus":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Biofiltration/detention pond in NE portion of site and associated retaining walls within electric easement zones"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":15}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan shows biofiltration/detention pond in northeast corner of site where multiple easements exist, including electric easements. Sheet 3 Block 20 note 16 prohibits 'detention ponds which would impair Austin Energy's access to transmission easements.' No clearance dimensions from pond or pond retaining walls to overhead electric facilities or easement boundaries are provided to verify 7.5-foot clearance from outside conductor to pond structures."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.31","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Entire site where vertical clearance from overhead facilities to proposed site features (driveways, parking, buildings) appears potentially marginal"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric lines and poles are visible on site plans with multiple facilities crossing over driveways, parking areas, and located adjacent to buildings (Transformer Pad near Bldg 2, OHE lines along property boundaries). No registered surveyor data showing pole locations and mid-span clearances is provided. Based on site plan scale and proximity of poles/lines to structures, vertical clearance verification by registered surveyor with mid-span clearance documentation is required but not submitted."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.37","status":"fail","codeCitations":["EC