overhead distribution primary and neutral conductors without dimensioned clearance exhibits."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Building faces and roofline projections (overhangs, awnings, balconies, canopies) relative to overhead electric lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets or section views provided showing building projections (overhangs, awnings, balconies, decks, roofs, patios) relative to overhead electric conductors. Without surveyed overhead conductor elevations and dimensioned clearances on elevation or section drawings, compliance with 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances from projections cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All proposed buildings within potential clearance distance of overhead electric facilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets are provided in the site plan set. Surveyed elevations and locations of overhead electric conductors cannot be verified as included on building elevation sheets because no such sheets exist. Building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor elevation data and clearance dimension annotations are required to demonstrate required clearances are met."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All buildings and permanent structures on site (Bldgs 1-8)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum